Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:06.62,Caption,,0,0,0,,Replay paused at the supervisor hold. The operator request includes the stopping context.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.62,0:00:09.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,The Operator owns the original Session. Automation cannot act.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.66,0:00:14.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,A competing Replay was refused with control_lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.46,0:00:19.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,The Operator enters synthetic supervisor values in the same application Session.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.53,0:00:23.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,Authorize releases the hold. Both balances are now visible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.10,0:00:28.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,The request records observed field changes and the confirmed action. Future runs must ask a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.14,0:00:34.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,Control returns to automation. Replay verifies the account screen before extracting balances.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.70,0:00:39.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,Verified success: available 2730.11 USD; current 2905.60 USD. One Session throughout.
